  "featuresFuture2Body": "Expected yield and operating period are clearly stated at fundraising, so you can aim for medium- to long-term wealth building without watching the market to decide when to buy or sell.",
  "featuresFuture3Title": "Early exit also possible with no fees",
  "featuresFuture3Body": "Receive monthly distributions while also being able to exit early with no fees. Adjust your investment plan flexibly as your life plans change.",
  "featuresFutureNote": "* Yields and operating periods are estimates and do not guarantee future performance. * Profits and losses may fluctuate due to real estate market conditions and other factors. * Monthly distributions apply only to income-gain-type eligible funds. Distributions are made only when the fund generates a profit. * A sale is possible only when a buyer is found; liquidity is not guaranteed. * “No fees” refers to transfer fees received by our company.",
  "featuresNow1Title": "Hold your investment and earn Host Miles monthly",
  "featuresNow1Body": "Earn Host Miles for hotel stays every month based on your Host Fund balance. Earning rates and booking windows vary by rank.",
  "featuresNow2Title": "Book hotels with Host Miles",
  "featuresNow2Body": "Use accumulated Host Miles to book STELLAVIA hotels. Enjoy not only investment returns, but the experience of travel today.",
  "featuresNow3Title": "Stay at your booked hotel and experience it firsthand",
  "featuresNow3Body": "Stay at a hotel you invested in or booked, and experience its appeal firsthand—beyond numbers and photos.",
  "featuresNowNote": "* The Host Miles program may be changed in the future. * Check My Page for your current rank and mileage earning rate.",
  "featuresFaqTitle": "FAQ",
  "featuresFaqCta": "See all FAQs",
  "featuresFaq1Q": "What kind of service is STELLAVIA?",
  "featuresFaq1A": "A service that lets you invest in hotel-focused Host Funds from ¥10,000 per unit. In addition to distributions, its key feature is Host Benefits, which earns Host Miles for hotel stays based on your assets under management.",
  "featuresFaq2Q": "Is there a fee to register as a Host?",
  "featuresFaq2A": "Host registration is free.",
  "featuresFaq3Q": "How much do I need to start investing?",
  "featuresFaq3A": "You can invest from ¥10,000 per unit.",
  "featuresFaq4Q": "How do I earn Host Miles?",
  "featuresFaq4A": "Each month, Host Miles are earned by applying your rank rate (0.5–0.6% monthly) to your total assets under management across all funds.",
  "featuresFaq5Q": "How do I book with Host Miles?",
  "featuresFaq5A": "From “Hotels You Can Stay At” on My Page, choose an available date, number of guests, and room. Your booking is confirmed when the miles are used, and a confirmation email is sent immediately.",
  "featuresReturnsFutureH": "Aim for investment returns",
  "featuresReturnsFutureBody": "Invest in host funds with expected annual yields of 6–10%. Build medium- to long-term wealth without watching the market to decide when to buy or sell.",
  "featuresReturnsFutureNote": "* Expected annual yields vary by Host Fund offering and do not guarantee future performance. * Returns may fluctuate due to real estate market conditions and other factors.",
  "featuresReturnsNowH": "Travel with Host Miles",
  "featuresReturnsNowBody": "Use your Host Miles to book STELLAVIA hotels and enjoy the experience of travel today.",
